{"key":"electorate-of-saxony","name":{"ru":"Курфюршество Саксония","en":"Electorate of Saxony"},"group":false,"from":1363,"to":1805,"founded":1356,"dissolved":1806,"area":[[1363,1374,5458],[1375,1384,5675],[1385,1428,5458],[1487,1491,34208],[1492,1501,34252],[1502,1528,34026],[1529,1546,34074],[1547,1551,34511],[1552,1555,34687],[1556,1563,25005],[1564,1578,25595],[1579,1587,25660],[1588,1618,25836],[1619,1621,26011],[1622,1625,25836],[1626,1628,25572],[1629,1631,25550],[1632,1635,25550],[1636,1639,35112],[1640,1641,26514],[1642,1644,17752],[1645,1647,17796],[1648,1682,35177],[1683,1699,32670],[1763,1790,33373],[1791,1802,33395],[1803,1804,33705],[1805,1805,33683]],"capitals":[{"key":null,"ru":"Виттенберг","en":"Lutherstadt Wittenberg","from":1356,"to":1547},{"key":null,"ru":"Дрезден","en":"Dresden","from":1547,"to":1806}],"flag":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Flag%20of%20Electoral%20Saxony.svg?width=160","coat":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Blason%20Jean-Georges%20IV%20de%20Saxe.svg?width=160","predecessors":[{"key":null,"ru":"Саксен-Виттенберг","en":"Duchy of Saxe-Wittenberg"}],"successors":[{"key":"kingdom-of-saxony","ru":"Королевство Саксония","en":"Kingdom of Saxony"}],"summary":{"ru":"Курфюршество Саксония — государственное образование, существовавшее с 1356 по 1806 годы и входившее в состав Священной Римской империи.","en":"The Electorate of Saxony, 1356 to 1806, was an Electorate of the Holy Roman Empire. Centred on the Duchy of Saxe-Wittenberg with its capital at Dresden, Saxony was one of the most significant states within the empire. Formally known as the Prince-Elector of Saxony, its rulers came first from the House of Ascania until 1422, then the House of Wettin until 1806, when it was replaced by the Kingdom of Saxony."},"wikipedia":{"ru":"https://ru.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%A1%D0%B0%D0%BA%D1%81%D0%BE%D0%BD%D0%B8%D1%8F_(%D0%BA%D1%83%D1%80%D1%84%D1%8E%D1%80%D1%88%D0%B5%D1%81%D1%82%D0%B2%D0%BE)","en":"https://en